<!--
  The three top-level screens. `/` is not listed: it redirects to `/ships`, and
  a sitemap entry for a redirect is an entry for a page that does not exist.

  Hull pages (`/ships/<symbol>`) are absent, and their absence is deliberate
  rather than forgotten: the set of hulls belongs to the Almanac, and a
  hand-written list of hull symbols here would be the private copy of package
  data constitution I forbids. Listing them means a generator that reads the
  installed package, which is a build step. Recorded as the highest-value
  follow-up in specs/011-interface-foundations/design/search-visibility.md.
-->
